Banker's Daylight design system applied to Angular frontend

Implements docs/DESIGN_SPEC.md visual direction in the live app:
- Light-first token sheet (warm paper, charcoal ink, slate-blue brand,
  muted gold accents) + fully tuned dark mode via data-theme attribute;
  toggle in header, persisted, defaults to OS preference
- Editorial report: Source Serif 4 masthead and section headings, gold
  section numbers and rule, CONFIDENTIAL marker, ticker chip
- Verdict cards row incl. derived risk profile from the risk matrix
- Summary/Detailed report toggle with dynamic contiguous section
  numbering; summary collapses to exec summary, tiles, risk titles
- Red flag bands, gold-ruled citation blockquotes, verified-claim
  checkmarks, mono tabular numerals across data
- Restyled header pills, pipeline stepper, runs sidebar, how-it-works
- Inter / Source Serif 4 / JetBrains Mono with system fallbacks;
  reduced-motion support; body transition removed (Chromium quirk)

